  "title": "Prince of Peace",
  "lyrics": [
    "Verse 1:",
    "You are [G]holy (you are holy)",
    "You are [C]mighty (You are mighty)",
    "You are [Am]worthy (You are worthy)",
    "Worthy of [Dsus4]praise (Worthy of [D]praise)",
    "I will [G]follow (I will follow)",
    "I will [C]listen (I will listen)",
    "I will [Am]love You (I will love You)",
    "[D]All of my [G]days ([D]All of my [G]days)",
    "",
    "Chorus 1:",
    "I will [C]sing to and [D]worship",
    "The [Em]King who is [G]worthy",
    "And I will [C]love and [D]adore Him",
    "And I will [Em]bow down [G]before Him (repeat)",
    "",
    "Chorus 2:",
    "You are [C]Lord of lords, You are [D]King of kings",
    "You are [Em]Mighty God, Lord of [G]everything",
    "You're [C]Emmanuel, You're the [D]great I AM",
    "You're my [Em]Prince of Peace who [G]is the Lamb",
    "You're the [C]Living God, You're my [D]saving grace",
    "You will [Em]reign forever, You are [G]Ancient of Days",
    "You are [C]Alpha, Omega, [D]Beginning and End",
    "You're my [Em]Saviour, Messiah, [G]Redeemer and Friend",
    "",
    "Chorus 3:",
    "You're my [C]Prince of peace and I will [Dsus4]live my [D]life for [G]You"
